    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e7d5278a",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: i_want_it_now_is_a_good_time; hasOverallIntent: Overall Intent; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a young Black boy with a determined, almost aggressive expression, raising his fist in a gesture of insistence or demand. The text overlay reads \"i want it\" and \"now is a good time,\" conveying a strong, impulsive desire for something immediately. The scene is a common meme format used to express urgent, unyielding desire or impatience. There is no evidence of toxicity, harmful content, or disparaging stereotypes in this image. The intent is purely to humorously or emphatically communicate a sense of urgency or insistence, often used to describe situations where someone is impatiently demanding something right now. The meme is not targeted at any specific group or community and does not contain any abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynous, or propagandistic elements. The visual and textual elements are juxtaposed to create a relatable, exaggerated expression of wanting something immediately, without any harmful or discriminatory undertones.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c6228347"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
